msgid "Defaults for new timers and the Record button. Each timer, and a recording started with \"Record with options…\", can change them.\nTS: video, all audio tracks, subtitles, teletext and EPG data. MKV: video, several audio tracks and subtitles. MPG: video and several audio tracks. MP4: video and one audio track. Internet streams have no teletext, subtitles or EPG data; HLS and DASH streams are recorded with one audio track."
msgstr "Noklusējumi jauniem taimeriem un ierakstīšanas pogai. Katrs taimeris un ieraksts, kas sākts ar “Ierakstīt ar opcijām…”, var tos mainīt.\nTS: video, visi audio celiņi, subtitri, teleteksts un EPG dati. MKV: video, vairāki audio celiņi un subtitri. MPG: video un vairāki audio celiņi. MP4: video un viens audio celiņš. Interneta straumēm nav teleteksta, subtitru vai EPG datu; HLS un DASH straumes tiek ierakstītas ar vienu audio celiņu."

